     [38;5;246mES modules + index.html. Zero deps, runs by opening the file. Fastest to a working app; view layer is swappable [39m
     [38;5;246mlater if it becomes the bottleneck.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Preact or Svelte + Vite
     [38;5;246mLightweight component model with a real build step. Middle ground on weight and capability.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m React + Vite + TypeScript
     [38;5;246mHeaviest setup, most conventional. Types help keep the data model server-shaped. Pick if you're confident this [39m
     [38;5;246mbecomes a real product.[39m
